+# Xbox 360 "Xenos" (ATI C1): the R400 ancestor of Adreno 200. Same shader ISA and
+# command processor; render targets live in 10MB of EDRAM addressed in 80x16-sample
+# tiles (5120 bytes at 32bpp), with an even number of tiles per line.
